Monty includes selected modules from CPython under the accompanying Python licence.
The upstream revision is recorded in vendor.toml. Monty embeds the source and
compiles it on import. The colorsys source is unmodified. In keyword, Monty
replaces the bound frozenset membership methods with Python functions. In stat,
Monty removes the optional _stat accelerator import. In textwrap, Monty removes
the del statements and calls pattern.search directly. In io, Monty removes the
abstract base classes, the Reader and Writer protocols and the _io names it does
not provide. See patches/ for the source changes.
